ebruary came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, on the county&rsquo;s middle value, April to May hit 140% of normal and November to December fell to 47%. So far in 2026, on the county&rsquo;s middle value, January to February sits at 46% of normal. Grid 17866 shows a preliminary estimate of 42.2 for August to September 2026, and that number can still change.</p>"}
